---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Contact Us | Get a Free Pest Control Quote | Zero Pest Control"
description: "Request a free pest control quote in Sudbury, Espanola, Elliot Lake, Blind River, Manitoulin, or Sault Ste. Marie. Call (705) 980-2006 or fill out our form."
permalink: /contact/
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Contact</p>
    <h1>Request Pest Control Service</h1>
    <p class="lede">Same day or next day service available. Clear quotes before any work begins — no surprises.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--3" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <a class="card reveal" href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">
        <div class="icon-badge">{{ icon("phone") }}</div>
        <h3>Call Us Now</h3>
        <p style="font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink);">{{ site.phone }}</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card reveal" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">
        <div class="icon-badge">{{ icon("mail") }}</div>
        <h3>Email</h3>
        <p style="font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); word-break:break-word;">{{ site.email }}</p>
      </a>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="icon-badge">{{ icon("clock") }}</div>
        <h3>Hours</h3>
        {% for h in site.hours %}
        <p style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">{{ h.label }}:</strong> {{ h.value }}</p>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="split reveal" style="align-items:flex-start;">
      <div>
        {% include "partials/quote-form.njk" %}
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="section-head">
          <p class="section-eyebrow">Service Areas</p>
          <h2>Where We Work</h2>
          <p>We provide residential and commercial pest control across Northern Ontario, including:</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="check-list" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
          {% for area in site.areas %}
          <li>{{ icon("map-pin") }} <span>{{ area.name }}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:0.92rem;">Outside these areas? Contact us anyway — we may still be able to help or point you in the right direction.</p>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:2rem;">
          <h3>What Happens Next?</h3>
          <ul class="check-list" style="margin-top:1rem;">
            <li>{{ icon("check") }} <span>We'll contact you, usually within one business day, to confirm details.</span></li>
            <li>{{ icon("check") }} <span>We'll schedule an inspection and provide a clear written quote.</span></li>
            <li>{{ icon("check") }} <span>No work begins until you approve the quote.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
